          "body": "The first image: the skull in the Union Jack bowler, the crossed umbrellas below it. One print, one question, and a name that hadn’t been earned yet. The whole brand is an argument with this image, and this is where the argument started. [PLACEHOLDER — REPLACE WITH FINAL COPY]"
